ernWallet</a><span data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih>/</span><a href="/retirement/" data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih>Retirement</a><span data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih>/</span><span class="crumb-current" data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih>401k Loan Calculator</span></nav><header class="hero" data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih><h1 data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih>401(k) Loan Calculator</h1><div class="byline" data-astro-cid-oxbng3yr> <span class="by" data-astro-cid-oxbng3yr>By <a href="/about/" data-astro-cid-oxbng3yr>Jonathan Velez</a>, Personal Finance Writer &amp; Editor</span> <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-oxbng3yr>·</span> <span class="rev" data-astro-cid-oxbng3yr>Reviewed against primary sources · Updated November 14, 2026</span> </div>  <p class="lede" data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih>With no earlier plan loans, you can borrow up to half your vested balance, capped at $50,000, with a $10,000 floor. Loans you already owe and your highest plan-loan balance in the past 12 months can lower that amount. The calculator subtracts what you owe. It returns the largest new loan allowed and the payment for the amount you want to borrow. Start with Vested account balance, then enter any Plan loans you owe now and your Highest plan-loan balance, last 12 months. Add the Loan amount you want, Interest rate (APR), Term (years), Payments per year and Loan purpose to see the repayment figures and any rule warnings.</p><p class="lede" data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih>In our internal modeling, we applied the loan-limit formula to a $60,000 vested balance with no earlier loans. The limit on all plan loans together was $30,000, leaving $30,000 available for a new loan. For a $10,000 loan at an example 8% annual percentage rate (APR), the payment was $202.76 per month over 5 years. Total interest was $2,165.84, and total repaid was $12,165.84. Those payment figures use a level-payment schedule. They do not establish the rate your plan would charge. Change the inputs below to see how a different loan amount, rate or payment schedule changes the result.</p><div class="proof" data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih><span class="proof-stat" data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih><strong data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih>$30,000</strong>largest new loan at $60,000 vested</span><span class="proof-stat" data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih><strong data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih>$202.76</strong>payment on $10,000 over 5 years</span><span class="proof-stat" data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih><strong data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih>$2,166</strong>total interest</span></div></header><div class="tool-wrap" data-astro-cid-2e7mcdih><button type="button" class="share-btn" data-share-title="401(k) Loan Calculator" aria-label="Share this tool" data-astro-cid-qan2qojn> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-qan2qojn><path d="M12 3v12M7.5 7.5 12 3l4.5 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-qan2qojn></path><path d="M5 12v7a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-qan2qojn></path></svg> <span class="share-label" data-astro-cid-qan2qojn>Share</span> </button> <span class="share-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-qan2qojn></span> <script>
